.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH starforge 1  StarForge "User Manual"
.SH NAME
starforge \- ⚡ Stellar & Soroban developer productivity CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstarforge\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stellar & Soroban developer productivity CLI.
.PP
StarForge wraps the Stellar CLI with wallet management, contract testing and audits, deployment lifecycle management, AI\-assisted development, and community contract templates. Commands are grouped by noun: wallet, contract, deploy, network, template, plugin, ai, config, project, tool. See docs/CLI_COMMAND_TREE.md for the full tree.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
starforge\-wallet(1)
Manage test wallets (create, list, fund, show, remove)
.TP
starforge\-account(1)
On\-chain account lifecycle with sponsored reserves (CAP\-33)
.TP
starforge\-nl(1)
Natural language command interface
.TP
starforge\-new(1)
Generate Soroban project boilerplate
.TP
starforge\-contract(1)
Contract operations (invoke, build, test, audit, upgrade, inspect, monitor)
.TP
starforge\-deploy(1)
Deploy a compiled Soroban contract (.wasm)
.TP
starforge\-deployments(1)
Deployment history, rollback, verification, and dashboard
.TP
starforge\-info(1)
Show starforge config and environment info
.TP
starforge\-prompts(1)
Manage AI prompt templates and versioning
.TP
starforge\-explain(1)
Analyze and explain smart contract code using AI
.TP
starforge\-config(1)
Manage starforge configuration (telemetry, network)
.TP
starforge\-telemetry(1)
Manage telemetry settings directly
.TP
starforge\-tx(1)
Fetch a transaction for the account
.TP
starforge\-sep10(1)
SEP\-10 web authentication for Stellar anchors
.TP
starforge\-network(1)
View or switch the active network, run a local node, simulate, snapshot
.TP
starforge\-template(1)
Manage community contract templates, versions, and the registry
.TP
starforge\-plugin(1)
Manage third\-party plugins
.TP
starforge\-ai(1)
AI\-assisted development: local assistant, audits, tests, search, planning
.TP
starforge\-config(1)
Manage starforge configuration, telemetry, feature flags, and privacy
.TP
starforge\-project(1)
Project scaffolding and AI\-driven project management
.TP
starforge\-tool(1)
Developer\-environment utilities: tutorials, natural language, PR checks
.TP
starforge\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions for bash, zsh, fish, and powershell
.TP
starforge\-man(1)
Generate or install man pages
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
